# LLM-0005 — Escape-hatch order and per-path slug resolution

Status: accepted (2026-09-20). The record is canonical: py/src/jeve/llm/decisions/LLM-0005-escape-hatch-order-and-per-path-slug-resolution.md

Slugs are still resolved against the live catalogue at startup, but per path: an unknown decision slug is fatal, an unknown generative slug drops out of the preference list, and only a generative list that resolves to nothing is an error — raised when prose is requested, not at startup.

This decision is immutable. To change it, write a new record and set `superseded-by` on this one — do not edit its substance.
